WEBVTT

00:15.080 --> 00:17.490
Are you awake, Master?

00:19.940 --> 00:23.580
Breakfast is ready. Will you be eating?

00:24.800 --> 00:26.490
Did you make it, Nephy?

00:26.490 --> 00:27.080
Yes.

00:27.580 --> 00:31.380
Have you been waiting 
there for me to wake up?

00:31.700 --> 00:34.440
I was watching your face.

00:34.440 --> 00:35.880
I-I see...

00:39.400 --> 00:40.580
One other thing, Nephy.

00:40.580 --> 00:41.270
Yes?

00:42.360 --> 00:43.390
Good morning.

00:43.740 --> 00:44.570
Yes.

00:44.570 --> 00:46.020
Good morning, Master.

00:46.430 --> 00:49.020
<i>I managed a proper greeting this time!</i>

01:03.000 --> 01:10.090
<b>An Archdemon's Dilemma:
How to Love Your Elf Bride</b>

02:18.990 --> 02:23.990
<b>Episode 3:
 The Quieter They Are, The More Devastatingly
Scary They Are When They're Angry</b>

02:26.370 --> 02:28.790
This dining hall used to 
resemble a graveyard.

02:29.250 --> 02:31.500
Did you clean it all?

02:33.590 --> 02:35.240
Did we buy bread?

02:35.240 --> 02:37.210
No, I baked some earlier.

02:37.580 --> 02:39.180
What? By yourself?!

02:37.990 --> 02:39.180
<b>By yourself?!</b>

02:39.180 --> 02:40.870
Is that strange?

02:40.870 --> 02:42.220
I don't know.

02:42.220 --> 02:46.810
I've never personally encountered someone 
who could make something so delicious before.

02:47.120 --> 02:48.580
I see.

02:52.230 --> 02:54.820
<i>Does that mean she's happy?</i>

02:56.760 --> 02:58.400
Have you eaten already?

02:58.400 --> 02:59.610
No.

02:59.610 --> 03:00.820
They you should join me.

03:01.130 --> 03:04.700
I've... only prepared 
enough for you, Master.

03:05.050 --> 03:07.080
Were you going to skip breakfast?

03:07.080 --> 03:09.460
I forgot to prepare my own.

03:09.850 --> 03:13.000
Have half of mine, then. Sit down already.

03:13.000 --> 03:17.250
But... I've only prepared a 
seat for you, Master...

03:17.690 --> 03:20.170
Then you can sit here.

03:24.210 --> 03:26.430
I wouldn't dare do something so rude!

03:26.430 --> 03:29.620
Don't worry. I'm telling you it's fine.

03:29.620 --> 03:32.520
<i>Is there some reason 
I'm refusing to just let it go?!</i>

03:32.520 --> 03:34.020
<b>Gh...</b>

03:34.620 --> 03:37.520
As you wish, Master.

03:36.770 --> 03:37.520
Plop

03:37.520 --> 03:40.030
<i>She actually did it!</i>

03:40.350 --> 03:42.310
Go on. Eat.

03:42.310 --> 03:45.370
This is embarrassing, Master.

03:45.720 --> 03:47.250
That much is obvious.

03:47.250 --> 03:49.880
You're being mean, Master.

03:51.040 --> 03:53.620
Then, next time, make sure 
to prepare a seat for yourself.

03:53.620 --> 03:54.650
Right.

03:54.650 --> 03:56.910
Although, I wouldn't mind doing this again.

03:56.910 --> 03:58.130
I'll prepare a seat next time.

04:00.470 --> 04:03.630
Please, try some, Master.

04:03.630 --> 04:05.390
<i>Is she getting me back?!</i>

04:07.870 --> 04:09.540
It's warm.

04:09.540 --> 04:11.230
I mean the soup, okay?

04:12.980 --> 04:16.480
Yes... it's warm.

04:16.770 --> 04:18.730
<b>Days later</b>

04:23.430 --> 04:26.780
What is it you're always studying, Master?

04:27.050 --> 04:29.990
What do you mean? 
Can't you tell it's sorcery?

04:29.990 --> 04:37.250
I thought as much, but I wasn't sure 
what purpose those drawings serve.

04:37.710 --> 04:40.250
Is elven sorcery different?

04:40.690 --> 04:43.760
I... can't use sorcery.

04:45.030 --> 04:48.720
<i>Despite having much higher 
quality mana than average, huh?</i>

04:50.410 --> 04:54.890
Well, conceptually speaking,
 symbols like this contain certain powers.

04:55.220 --> 04:57.330
There's debate about what the writing is.

04:57.330 --> 05:00.430
It might be the language of the gods 
or the emblem of a pact with demons,

05:00.430 --> 05:02.940
but whatever the case, I don't really know.

05:03.280 --> 05:07.980
This is the blueprint for the most simple 
form of sorcery: a sorcerous circle.

05:07.980 --> 05:10.400
This one creates lightning.

05:10.400 --> 05:12.150
You channel mana into it and...

05:16.250 --> 05:20.250
That level of sorcery is like 
making a leaf float on water.

05:20.780 --> 05:24.410
But you can add symbols to the circle 
to increase its potency,

05:24.410 --> 05:29.000
direct it, expand its range,

05:29.000 --> 05:32.680
control the timing at which sorcery 
comes forth, among other things.

05:34.670 --> 05:36.280
Sorry about that.

05:36.280 --> 05:40.440
But all you need to do is channel 
some mana, and anyone can use it.

05:40.860 --> 05:44.110
Which necessitates a restriction that 
only lets the original caster use it.

05:44.660 --> 05:49.170
Without that bit, another sorcerer 
could hijack it with ease.

05:50.620 --> 05:53.950
The construction of these kind of 
sorcerous circles are called "circuits."

05:55.180 --> 05:56.190
Is something wrong?

05:56.190 --> 06:00.250
It's just... you've been making additions 
to the outside of the circuit, Master.

06:00.590 --> 06:03.170
Is it possible to add something inside of it?

06:04.430 --> 06:06.130
That's pretty insightful of you to notice.

06:06.130 --> 06:09.010
And the answer is that it's somewhat 
impossible, somewhat possible.

06:09.970 --> 06:15.260
It requires creating a second sorcerous circle
 inside of one that's already complete.

06:15.260 --> 06:17.580
Doing that disrupts the flow of mana,

06:17.580 --> 06:19.980
so both sorceries would
 either not activate or run amok.

06:20.400 --> 06:24.820
But if you had total control of the flow 
of mana, it would be possible.

06:24.820 --> 06:30.390
Does that mean... it's possible to 
override someone else's sorcery?

06:30.390 --> 06:31.780
Correct.

06:32.130 --> 06:36.350
And someone capable of that 
would be safe from all sorcery.

06:36.350 --> 06:40.250
They'd be able to fend off all 
manner of sorcerous attacks.

06:40.630 --> 06:43.750
Theoretically, it'd result in the 
most powerful sorcerer of all time.

06:44.170 --> 06:47.010
Still, that's only theoretical.

06:47.010 --> 06:50.070
If it were that easy, everybody would do it.

06:50.070 --> 06:53.800
Besides, no one studies that 
kind of thing seriously.

06:53.800 --> 06:57.810
<i>Although there are people crazy 
enough to poke around at the idea.</i>

06:58.160 --> 07:00.990
I think I understand a bit 
of sorcerous theory now.

07:00.990 --> 07:01.900
But...

07:01.900 --> 07:06.610
Does that mean anyone can use it, 
as long as they know how it works?

07:06.930 --> 07:10.760
<i>I think Nephy might have 
a real knack for this.</i>

07:10.760 --> 07:11.740
You're right.

07:12.260 --> 07:16.730
For sorcerers, knowledge is a 
direct correlation to power.

07:16.730 --> 07:18.830
And that's why we put
together tricks and traps

07:18.830 --> 07:21.120
to avoid that knowledge being stolen.

07:21.480 --> 07:24.980
Be careful when touching 
anything in here, okay, Nephy?

07:26.390 --> 07:30.760
That was a joke! I've altered the 
traps so that you won't trigger them.

07:31.940 --> 07:34.800
Master... you're teasing me.

07:35.170 --> 07:36.610
You almost sound happy about that.

07:37.620 --> 07:40.460
How did you know?

07:40.460 --> 07:41.540
Well...

07:41.540 --> 07:42.270
<i>Your ears...</i>

07:43.940 --> 07:48.690
You've never spoken at such 
lengths to me before, Master.

07:49.010 --> 07:52.010
Well, sorcery is really all I have!

07:52.010 --> 07:54.950
I guess it's easier to talk about 
specialized knowledge you have.

07:55.440 --> 07:58.760
May I ask you a question, Master?

07:58.760 --> 07:59.450
What is it?

07:59.970 --> 08:04.950
What do you intend to do with 
such incredible power?

08:07.090 --> 08:08.670
Forgive me.

08:08.670 --> 08:10.880
It must not have been an 
appropriate question.

08:10.880 --> 08:13.130
No, it's not that.

08:13.460 --> 08:15.660
I've just never thought about it before.

08:15.660 --> 08:19.100
If I had to give an answer... 
Survive, I guess?

08:20.430 --> 08:21.430
Survive?

08:21.820 --> 08:24.710
When I was young, I didn't have 
any money or a place to live.

08:24.710 --> 08:26.650
I had to steal everything 
I needed to survive.

08:27.400 --> 08:29.520
And even I had it better than others did.

08:29.520 --> 08:31.910
I managed to avoid being killed.

08:32.400 --> 08:35.850
But then one day, I was 
captured by a sorcerer.

08:36.410 --> 08:40.480
Children make great sacrifices, after all.

08:40.480 --> 08:44.920
I managed to turn it around on him 
before I was actually killed, but...

08:44.920 --> 08:48.670
That was when I learned that if I wanted 
to stay alive, I needed to become strong.

08:49.020 --> 08:51.320
Which is what I want to do.

08:51.320 --> 08:55.930
It might sound a little trite as a goal, 
but immortality would be ideal.

08:56.460 --> 08:59.810
I was never able to become that strong.

09:03.370 --> 09:04.810
You know, Nephy,

09:05.240 --> 09:06.940
if you have any interest in sorcery—

09:12.880 --> 09:17.510
We've got company. I'll go and see to them. 
You should prepare dinner, Nephy.

09:17.510 --> 09:21.120
Understood. For how many people?

09:21.120 --> 09:23.420
Just the two of us.

09:23.420 --> 09:25.620
These visitors will be going home soon.

09:25.990 --> 09:29.880
So the person responsible for the kidnappings 
is lurking in a place like this.

09:30.590 --> 09:33.840
We were just here! It feels like 
we're going around in circles!

09:33.840 --> 09:36.340
It's probably caused by a 
protective sorcerous barrier.

09:36.340 --> 09:37.090
I'll deal with it.

09:54.220 --> 09:55.750
Good grief.

09:55.750 --> 09:59.780
Does the church not teach how to
 act when calling on someone?

09:59.780 --> 10:01.160
How dare you!

10:02.690 --> 10:04.750
Then, it really is you.

10:05.120 --> 10:06.750
Have we met before?

10:07.290 --> 10:09.500
<i>Considering how it tore through my barrier,</i>

10:09.500 --> 10:11.860
<i>that must be one of the the famous Sacred Swords.</i>

10:11.860 --> 10:15.710
<i>One of the twelve blades that are said 
to have slain the Lord of Fiends.</i>

10:16.050 --> 10:18.090
<i>The symbol of the Church's strength.</i>

10:18.580 --> 10:21.050
<i>And a young girl like her is wielding it?</i>

10:21.610 --> 10:23.390
<i>Come to think of it, she looks familiar.</i>

10:24.980 --> 10:27.730
<i>Oh, yeah. She's that girl 
who was almost killed.</i>

10:27.730 --> 10:29.980
<i>If I had known she was an Angelic Knight,</i>

10:29.980 --> 10:32.980
<i>I wouldn't have have let her go.</i>

10:32.980 --> 10:37.990
<b>An Archdemon's Dilemma:
How to Love Your Elf Bride</b>

10:42.520 --> 10:45.490
You know, I have better things to be doing!

10:50.960 --> 10:55.070
<i>The defensive power of that anointed 
armor they have is impressive.</i>

10:55.070 --> 10:57.170
<i>I may have been holding back, 
but it's not even scratched.</i>

10:57.170 --> 11:01.750
Attacking us unprovoked... 
Sorcerers really are all cowards!

11:01.750 --> 11:05.010
Lady Chastille, leave this wretch 
to the Three Cerulean Knights!

11:05.010 --> 11:08.430
Will you go home after 
I slap you around some?

11:08.430 --> 11:09.850
Be silent!

11:16.590 --> 11:18.570
Now get out of my sight.

11:18.570 --> 11:23.950
Or are you going to make that skinny girl 
carry you three clods all by herself?

11:23.950 --> 11:25.450
This isn't over yet! I'll—

11:25.450 --> 11:26.830
Enough! Retreat!

11:26.830 --> 11:28.700
I cannot, Lady Chastille!

11:33.510 --> 11:34.540
Impossible...!

11:38.000 --> 11:40.990
Whoa, I wouldn't if I were you.

11:40.990 --> 11:45.200
I can pulp his head faster 
than you'd be able to strike.

11:48.990 --> 11:51.060
I'm glad to see you're a fast learner.

11:51.320 --> 11:55.810
Why torture him so? Are you so intent 
on dishonoring us after our loss?

11:56.140 --> 11:59.190
Do you know how to create fear?

11:59.190 --> 12:00.190
What?

12:00.530 --> 12:02.720
If I were to kill all of you,

12:02.720 --> 12:07.200
the ones who sent you would only make 
a passing note of four fatalities.

12:07.200 --> 12:13.330
In order to spread fear, I need you to 
survive and spread word of what happened.

12:13.330 --> 12:15.320
Like this, for instance.

12:17.050 --> 12:18.750
And that's why you won't kill us?

12:18.750 --> 12:20.260
You're lying.

12:21.490 --> 12:25.890
<i>I mean, yeah, if I started stacking up bodies 
around the house, it'd probably scare Nephy.</i>

12:26.520 --> 12:27.350
I knew it.

12:28.290 --> 12:29.080
<i>Not good.</i>

12:29.080 --> 12:31.590
<i>She can tell I'm not willing 
to kill the hostage.</i>

12:32.500 --> 12:37.520
On my commander's orders, I, Chastille Lillqvist, 
will now slay the sorcerer Zagan!

12:41.950 --> 12:43.450
<i>She barely touched it and look what happened.</i>

12:44.440 --> 12:46.780
<i>But it's not that powerful.</i>

12:46.780 --> 12:48.580
<i>The blessing of that anointed 
armor is helping,</i>

12:48.580 --> 12:50.590
<i>but at the end of the day, 
she's too small for this.</i>

12:51.450 --> 12:53.540
Why don't you fight back?!

12:53.540 --> 12:56.080
Are you trying to say I'm not 
worthy of your aggression?!

12:56.080 --> 12:58.920
I've never been good at attacking women.

13:00.320 --> 13:03.670
<i>Especially when she looks to be 
about the same age as Nephy.</i>

13:03.670 --> 13:05.090
Why?!

13:05.530 --> 13:06.780
Why...

13:06.780 --> 13:10.220
Why has someone like you... 
sullied his hands with sorcery?

13:10.220 --> 13:13.230
Is using sorcery some kind of crime?

13:13.230 --> 13:18.480
It's evil! It's mere existence ensures that
 people are oppressed and suffering!

13:18.480 --> 13:21.320
Then what about the power you wield?

13:21.320 --> 13:24.860
Is it for unilaterally killing any sorcerers 
that prove to be weaker than you?

13:29.200 --> 13:32.090
I'm not trying to justify myself,

13:32.090 --> 13:35.660
but there's no shortage of people 
who need sorcery to survive.

13:35.660 --> 13:38.930
And if you're going around crushing them 
as a means of securing your livelihood,

13:38.930 --> 13:41.670
you don't get to shout about 
how righteous you are.

13:42.500 --> 13:43.170
<i>I...</i>

13:44.060 --> 13:47.550
Even then... No, that's exactly why...

13:47.550 --> 13:50.050
I cannot lose!

13:50.050 --> 13:50.800
There!

13:54.430 --> 13:56.430
A test of might, then?

13:56.430 --> 13:58.110
You're on!

14:08.430 --> 14:12.120
<i>She was holding back all along?</i>

14:13.620 --> 14:16.130
<i>The regeneration from my healing 
sorcery isn't fast enough.</i>

14:16.130 --> 14:17.830
<i>Thanks to the Sacred Sword, I guess.</i>

14:21.400 --> 14:23.460
<i>I guess I'm out of options.</i>

14:23.460 --> 14:24.910
<i>She has to die.</i>

14:24.910 --> 14:26.260
Listen to me.

14:26.980 --> 14:30.590
Are you willing to pretend 
to be killed by me?

14:31.600 --> 14:34.750
The Church will hound you until you die.

14:34.750 --> 14:38.730
If I'm defeated, a stronger 
Angelic Knight will be sent in my stead.

14:38.730 --> 14:40.580
You should fake your own death.

14:40.580 --> 14:43.690
Then abandon sorcery,
 and live your life like a proper human.

14:44.140 --> 14:47.110
It's hard to believe I'm hearing 
this from an Angelic Knight.

14:47.110 --> 14:50.500
You didn't kill my men.

14:50.500 --> 14:55.080
You spoke of spreading fear, 
but I could see the mercy in your eyes.

14:55.650 --> 14:57.480
Mercy? From me?

14:57.480 --> 15:02.170
And most of all, I haven't 
forgotten that you saved my life.

15:02.480 --> 15:06.300
Forgive me... but this is the best I can do.

15:08.630 --> 15:12.150
<i>An Angelic Knight abetting a 
sorcerer is a serious crime.</i>

15:12.150 --> 15:14.760
<i>She's risking a lot to make me this offer.</i>

15:15.060 --> 15:16.180
<i>Still...</i>

15:16.180 --> 15:21.000
<i>I can't accept it. If I run, that 
means Nephy will be attacked.</i>

15:21.000 --> 15:22.200
Master!

15:26.690 --> 15:27.820
Stay back, Nephy!

15:27.820 --> 15:29.890
An ally of the sorcerer?!

15:30.970 --> 15:32.320
Torres, don't!

15:41.550 --> 15:42.710
Master!

15:45.150 --> 15:47.170
This is nothing.

15:54.240 --> 15:55.510
Wh-What in the...

15:55.920 --> 15:57.010
The forest...

15:59.800 --> 16:02.390
You hurt my master.

16:10.900 --> 16:12.340
You won't escape.

16:19.990 --> 16:21.450
That's enough! You can stop now!

16:21.450 --> 16:22.580
Don't do it, Nephy!

16:30.860 --> 16:32.170
<i>Is this...</i>

16:32.570 --> 16:35.330
<i>Nephy's power?</i>

16:41.890 --> 16:44.310
<i>The Angelic Knights withdrew.</i>

16:47.490 --> 16:50.270
I didn't intend on dragging 
any innocents into this.

16:50.270 --> 16:51.690
Forgive me.

16:51.690 --> 16:54.530
<i>Even in the end, she was acting guilty.</i>

16:56.660 --> 17:00.370
Nephy, I thought you said 
you couldn't use sorcery.

17:01.200 --> 17:03.330
That wasn't... sorcery.

17:03.750 --> 17:04.890
Then what was it?

17:06.380 --> 17:08.010
Well, whatever.

17:08.010 --> 17:11.260
It doesn't really matter to me 
what kind of power you wield.

17:12.600 --> 17:18.180
<i>Crap! That made it sound like 
I'm not interested in her!</i>

17:18.180 --> 17:21.690
You are Nephy. Nothing else matters.

17:22.590 --> 17:23.850
<i>There, I said it!</i>

17:24.350 --> 17:26.160
Thank you.

17:26.750 --> 17:29.380
Were you scared?

17:30.680 --> 17:32.860
You're asking me that?

17:34.640 --> 17:38.740
Don't you find me... unsettling, Master?

17:38.740 --> 17:40.120
Why would I?

17:41.890 --> 17:44.340
But...  before, I was...

17:44.340 --> 17:47.700
Yes, I had never seen power like that before.

17:47.700 --> 17:48.860
I'll admit, I'm interested.

17:48.860 --> 17:51.060
That's... all?

17:53.270 --> 17:54.630
That power...

17:54.950 --> 17:56.880
is known as mysticism.

17:56.880 --> 17:58.420
Mysticism?

17:58.420 --> 18:00.100
<i>It actually exists?</i>

18:00.630 --> 18:04.310
<i>Not a system of techniques composed 
with a basis in logic, like sorcery,</i>

18:04.310 --> 18:08.310
<i>but a miracle power that allows tapping into
 powers beyond natural law just by wishing it!</i>

18:08.600 --> 18:12.180
Can all elves use that kind of power?

18:12.690 --> 18:13.480
No...

18:14.320 --> 18:16.270
I can because I'm a cursed child.

18:16.770 --> 18:18.250
Look at her, grinning like that.

18:18.250 --> 18:19.680
It's so creepy.

18:19.680 --> 18:21.480
The trees in the western 
woods were moving again.

18:21.480 --> 18:23.490
Someone saw her muttering to herself.

18:23.490 --> 18:24.720
Ugh, it's so scary.

18:24.720 --> 18:25.930
We should cast her out!

18:25.930 --> 18:27.660
Shh! She'll curse you.

18:28.660 --> 18:31.850
This power isn't supposed to exist.

18:31.850 --> 18:35.960
Children with white hair aren't 
supposed to be born, so...

18:36.660 --> 18:37.920
<i>That look...</i>

18:38.230 --> 18:42.020
<i>"You aren't human. You don't get 
to have emotions or desires."</i>

18:42.020 --> 18:45.180
<i>The look of someone who's been 
told that for a long time...</i>

18:45.180 --> 18:47.650
One day, my village came under attack...

18:47.650 --> 18:51.690
And the villagers told me to 
use my power to protect them.

18:52.150 --> 18:55.360
"It's time you repay us for 
letting you live," they said.

18:55.680 --> 19:01.230
After they said that, it was like I could hear
 something breaking apart inside of my head.

19:02.200 --> 19:05.700
I was captured, without resisting at all.

19:06.330 --> 19:09.000
Everyone else ran away, so desperately.

19:09.000 --> 19:12.370
I don't think many who ran survived.

19:12.370 --> 19:15.090
Even elf corpses have their uses, after all.

19:16.120 --> 19:18.170
And when I saw that...

19:19.570 --> 19:22.180
I thought that they deserved 
what happened to them!

19:22.180 --> 19:28.060
Isn't that awful? As I saw the people who 
cursed my existence die, I laughed at them!

19:28.790 --> 19:31.940
"Now it's your turn to suffer!" I thought.

19:33.490 --> 19:37.400
I only realized what 
I had done after the fact.

19:38.170 --> 19:39.440
I...

19:40.140 --> 19:44.070
<i>That's why she stopped 
expressing her emotions.</i>

19:46.030 --> 19:47.200
I'm sorry.

19:47.700 --> 19:49.840
You must be disappointed.

19:49.840 --> 19:50.710
Why would I be?

19:52.180 --> 19:56.250
I would've killed the entire village,
 along with the attackers.

19:59.470 --> 20:03.640
Even then... I don't think 
what I did can be forgiven.

20:03.930 --> 20:05.470
Forgiven by who?

20:05.750 --> 20:08.850
By... the people of the village!

20:08.850 --> 20:11.940
But they're dead. So what does it matter?

20:12.270 --> 20:16.520
I doubt even they are so pathetic that 
they'd chide you from beyond the grave.

20:17.060 --> 20:19.370
When you have strength, 
you should live a strong life.

20:19.370 --> 20:23.000
Otherwise, it's an insult to those 
who die because they are powerless.

20:23.820 --> 20:26.430
Is it really all right for 
me to have this power?

20:26.430 --> 20:29.810
Well, let me ask you, is having 
power really that wrong?

20:29.810 --> 20:31.790
Is wanting to be strong evil?

20:32.260 --> 20:33.600
That's...

20:33.600 --> 20:34.580
If you're curious...

20:34.970 --> 20:36.960
I've been told it was evil.

20:38.700 --> 20:43.340
A long time ago, I saved a 
girl from a gang of robbers.

20:44.080 --> 20:46.590
When you're weak, it's only 
natural you get preyed on.

20:46.590 --> 20:48.850
If you don't want this to 
happen again, get strong.

20:49.550 --> 20:52.870
Are weak people not even allowed to live?

20:52.870 --> 20:55.560
Does flaunting your strength 
really make you so great?!

20:58.110 --> 21:02.500
I got the feeling that she had been 
treated really well growing up.

21:02.500 --> 21:06.500
Pity and kindness are toxic luxuries 
that can make people careless.

21:06.500 --> 21:09.330
Living that kind of cozy, 
coddled life had made her weak.

21:09.970 --> 21:14.780
I didn't want that to happen to me, 
so I've lived to become stronger.

21:16.380 --> 21:20.210
<i>Granted, that didn't exactly get 
me anywhere in particular.</i>

21:24.840 --> 21:26.050
My point is, Nephy...

21:26.050 --> 21:28.340
Don't make that face.

21:28.340 --> 21:30.220
I already told you I needed you, didn't I?

21:30.740 --> 21:33.930
I'm... really allowed to be here?

21:34.300 --> 21:35.680
Of course you are.

21:36.170 --> 21:38.300
Especially after the meal you provided me.

21:38.300 --> 21:41.190
I can't even imagine life 
without you, anymore.

23:29.970 --> 23:34.970
<b>Next Time:
When An Archdemon Offers You Anything,
You're Better Off Saying No</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.930
<b>In the
Lost
Woods</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.930
<b>I've marked
our path.</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.930
<b>
Maiden of the
 Sacred Sword</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.930
<b>Take it
down.</b>
